/**
 * NCBI genetic code 3 - Yeast Mitochondrial.
 *
 * Differs from `STANDARD` in 6 codons: `ATA` -> `M`, `CTA` -> `T`, `CTC` -> `T`, `CTG` -> `T`,
 * `CTT` -> `T`, `TGA` -> `W`.
 *
 * NCBI additionally marks `CGA` and `CGC` as absent in this code rather
 * than as arginine. A map cannot express "absent", so they are kept as
 * `R` here; a sequence relying on that distinction needs a hand check.
